# Project TITAN Professional V1.0 — 현재 진행상황

**Official lock:** `2026-07-02` · **Direction:** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-v1-development-direction.mdc` · `src/config/titanV1DevelopmentDirection.js`

**Vision:** NDK 품질관리 업무 통합 QMS · V1.0 독립 실행형 완성 → V1.1 MES 연동 → V2.0 고도화

**Core promise:** *"MES 때문에 흔들리지 않는다"*

